<html lang='en'>
  <head>
    <meta charset='UTF-8' />
    <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0' />
    <title>Welcome to PePP Cruise</title>
    <style>
      body {
        font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        background-color: #f8fafc;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 20px;
      }
      .container {
        background-color: #ffffff;
        padding: 30px;
        border-radius: 12px;
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(95, 61, 244, 0.1);
        text-align: center;
      }
      .header {
        border-bottom: 2px solid #5f3df4;
        padding-bottom: 20px;
        margin-bottom: 30px;
      }
      .logo {
        max-width: 120px;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
      }
      .brand-name {
        color: #5f3df4;
        font-size: 24px;
        font-weight: bold;
        margin: 0;
      }
      h1 {
        color: #1a202c;
        font-size: 28px;
        margin: 20px 0;
      }
      p {
        color: #4a5568;
        line-height: 1.6;
        text-align: left;
        margin: 15px 0;
      }
      .highlight-box {
        background-color: #f7fafc;
        border-left: 4px solid #5f3df4;
        padding: 20px;
        margin: 25px 0;
        border-radius: 8px;
      }
      .cta-button {
        display: inline-block;
        background-color: #5f3df4;
        color: white;
        text-decoration: none;
        padding: 15px 30px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin-top: 25px;
        font-size: 16px;
        transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
      }
      .cta-button:hover {
        background-color: #4c2cc7;
      }
      .footer {
        margin-top: 30px;
        padding-top: 20px;
        border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
        font-size: 14px;
        color: #718096;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class='container'>
      <div class='header'>
        <h2 class='brand-name'>PePP Cruise</h2>
      </div>

      <h1>🎉 You're Invited to Join PePP Cruise</h1>

      <p>
        Hello! We're excited to invite your organization to join the PePP Cruise
        platform. Our professional cruise management solutions are designed to transform how your
        organization operates and scales.
      </p>

      <p>
        To complete your organization's onboarding process, please click the
        button below to create your admin account and set up your organization
        profile.
      </p>

      <a href='{{invitationLink}}' class='cta-button'>
        Accept Invitation & Get Started
      </a>

      <p>
        This invitation is valid until
        {{expiryDate}}. If you have any questions or need assistance during the
        setup process, our support team is here to help.
      </p>

      <div class='footer'>
        <p>Best regards,<br />The PePP Cruise Team</p>
        <p>
          If you did not expect this invitation, please ignore this email or
          <a href='mailto:support@peppcruise.com' style='color: #5F3DF4;'>contact
            our support team</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>